From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:28:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/device/nic_bridged: Restrict host-side routes in
 restricted projects
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The route keys were installed in the host's routing table without any
project check. They must now fall within the project's
restricted.networks.subnets entries for the bridge.

This addresses GHSA-cwm9-v375-rgvv (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 2039ff90024412e8b2290c0c327e7d34f65420e5)
